</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00461/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一本███页的小说，每次打开时名称、内容、人名和对话都会转变为其他小说的内容<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██市██街新华书店<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于Site-CN-██的图书室中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>古之帝王一把抓住李狗蛋的脖子？——正在新华书店买书的研究员guzl</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00461" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00461" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00461-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/guzl" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6264210); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6264210&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605988658" alt="guzl" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6264210)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/guzl" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6264210); return false;">guzl</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1605343870 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">14 Nov 2020 08:51</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00221/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个████牌头戴式耳机，在被人用来听歌时，使用者会不自觉地唱出正在听的歌<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Dr.pigeon的办公室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被放置于Site-██低价值异常物品收容室中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>I want something just like this～Oh, I want something just like this～</em>——正在使用项目听歌的Dr.pigeon<br />
<em>Oh,I want something just he stop！</em>——被Dr.pigeon的歌声折磨到崩溃的特工fan</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00221" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00221" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00221-hovertip">
